{"product_id":"yu-gi-oh-duelist-vol-8","title":"Yu-Gi-Oh! Duelist, Vol. 8","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn the second saga of the Yu-Gi-Oh! epic, Duel Monsters is the world's most popular collectible card game-but to Yugi, it's the most dangerous game of all! Entering the Duel Monsters world championship, Yugi fights ruthless opponents like game designer Maximillion Pegasus and teenage multimillionaire Kaiba Seto, hoping to discover the origin of the game...and his own powers! Contains the original storyline of the first season of Yu-Gi-Oh!, including scenes too startling for TV!Yugi's beaten the champions of Duel Monsters...but now it's time to meet the maker! In the final battle of the tournament, Yugi faces ultra-rich game designer Maximillion Pegasus with the soul of his grandfather at stake! As cards fly, Yugi and Pegasus turn to the darker side of their decks, unleashing sinister monsters of the netherworld. But Pegasus has the power of the mind-scanning Millennium Eye...and how can Yugi defeat an opponent who knows exactly what he's going to do?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kazuki Takahashi\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781591169987\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45841447387289,"sku":"Manga-A-39781591169987","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69024fe76e77a_images__7.jpg?v=1761759478","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/yu-gi-oh-duelist-vol-8","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}